WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:03.840
Pánfilo Natera, general of the Division of the Center.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.910
In mid-June he failed before this city.

3
00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:09.335
Today he returns.

4
00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:11.475
Forward, boys!

5
00:00:20.448 --> 00:00:23.478
Villa and Natera close the ring around Cerro del Grillo.

